Let out a mental cry that shatters the will of your targets within radius 10, dealing [59, 79, 95, 108, 120 (TL1-5; CUN 100; SP 100)] darkness damage and confusing ([20%, 28%, 34%, 40%, 45% (TL1-5)] to act randomly) them for [9, 10, 10, 10, 10 (TL1-5; CUN 100; SP 100)] turns.

The damage will improve with your spellpower and the duration will improve with your Cunning.
